
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#030d1c">
  <title>Liam Jatiko | Gaming</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="navbar">
  <a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="logo">LJ</span> Liam Jatiko</a>

  <button id="menuToggle" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>

  <nav id="navLinks">
    <a class="active" href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#videos">Videos</a>
    <a href="#games">Games</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <input id="searchInput" class="search"
    type="search" placeholder="⌕  Search games, videos...">

  <div class="social-top">
    <a href="https://youtube.com/">▶</a>
    <a href="https://tiktok.com/">♪</a>
    <a href="https://discord.com/">◉</a>
  </div>

  <a class="button subscribe" href="#contact">Subscribe</a>
</header>

<main id="home">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="welcome">WELCOME TO</p>
      <h1>LIAM <span>JATIKO</span></h1>
      <h2>Gaming <span>•</span> Fun <span>•</span> Big Dreams</h2>
      <p>Roblox gameplay, challenges, and more! 🎮<br>
        Subscribe and join the fam!</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a class="button" href="#videos">▶ Watch Latest Video</a>
        <a class="button outline" href="#games">Explore Games</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="layout">

    <div class="main-column">
      <section id="games">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>🎮 Featured Games</h2>
          <a href="#games">View All →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="game-grid" id="gameGrid">

          <article class="game-card" data-search="roblox rivals">
            <img src="assets/rivals.jpg" alt="Roblox RIVALS">
            <div class="game-info">
              <div>
                <h3>Roblox RIVALS</h3>
                <p>Intense battles, crazy moments!</p>
              </div>
              <a class="arrow" href="#videos">➜</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="game-card" data-search="blox fruits">
            <img src="assets/blox-fruits.jpg" alt="Blox Fruits">
            <div class="game-info">
              <div>
                <h3>Blox Fruits</h3>
                <p>Level up. Get stronger. Be the best!</p>
              </div>
              <a class="arrow" href="#videos">➜</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="game-card" data-search="brookhaven rp">
            <img src="assets/brookhaven.jpg" alt="Brookhaven RP">
            <div class="game-info">
              <div>
                <h3>Brookhaven RP</h3>
                <p>Roleplay, chill, have fun!</p>
              </div>
              <a class="arrow" href="#videos">➜</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="game-card" data-search="obby games">
            <img src="assets/obby.jpg" alt="Obby Games">
            <div class="game-info">
              <div>
                <h3>Obby Games</h3>
                <p>Jump, climb, survive!</p>
              </div>
              <a class="arrow" href="#videos">➜</a>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>
        <p id="noResults" hidden>No games found.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="lower-grid" id="videos">
        <article class="video-card">
          <div class="video-image">
            <img src="assets/latest-video.jpg" alt="Latest RIVALS gameplay">
            <span class="play-icon">▶</span>
            <span class="duration">8:24</span>
          </div>

          <div class="video-info">
            <span class="pill">Latest Video</span>
            <h3>Roblox RIVALS – INSANE Gameplay Highlights!</h3>
            <p>Watch my best moments, funny clips, and intense fights in Roblox RIVALS!</p>
            <small>◉ 12.4K views · 2 days ago</small>
            <p><a class="button" href="#contact">Watch Now →</a></p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="join-card">
          <h3>♛ Join the Fam!</h3>
          <p>Subscribe for more awesome content and never miss an upload.</p>
          <a class="button" href="#contact">▶ Subscribe</a>
          <p class="thanks">Thanks for the support! 💙</p>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="sidebar">
      <section class="side-card" id="about">
        <h2>👤 About Me</h2>
        <p>Hey! I'm Liam Jatiko — a young gamer who loves Roblox and all kinds of games. I make gameplay videos, challenges, and fun content. Join the journey, hit subscribe, and be part of the fam! 💙</p>
        <div class="tags">
          <span>Gamer</span>
          <span>Creator</span>
          <span>Dreamer</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="side-card" id="contact">
        <h2>🔗 Follow Me</h2>
        <div class="follow-grid">
          <a href="https://youtube.com/">
            <b class="youtube">▶</b>
            <strong>YouTube</strong>
            <small>(Liam Jatiko)</small>
          </a>
          <a href="https://tiktok.com/">
            <b class="tiktok">♪</b>
            <strong>TikTok</strong>
            <small>(@liamjatiko)</small>
          </a>
          <a href="https://discord.com/">
            <b class="discord">◉</b>
            <strong>Discord</strong>
            <small>(Join my server)</small>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </aside>

  </div>
</main>

<footer>© <span id="year"></span> Liam Jatiko · Gaming, Fun & Big Dreams</footer>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
